-- ==============================================================
-- Kingsway Preparatory School Academy
-- 3NF/4NF Normalized Database (deliverable)
-- ==============================================================
--
-- Source : legacy dump `KingsWayDatabase_2026_08_01_1409hrs.sql`
-- Target : KingWayAcademy3nf
-- Scope  : full relational rebuild per docs 01-11 (431 plan entries)
--
-- Notes:
--   * Foreign-key constraints are intentionally NOT emitted
--     (referential integrity is enforced by the application layer
--     and by strict column typing/allowlists).
--   * All database objects are covered in Section 4: 84 views, 150
--     procedures, 21 functions, 58 triggers, 10 events (extracted from
--     the source dump; see docs/database_audit/02_objects_inventory.md).
--   * Objects that reference renamed/retired tables or reshaped columns
--     are emitted as commented-out [DROPPED] blocks with the exact server
--     error and the mapping-doc citation; they must be re-authored against
--     the target schema before use (73 views + 23 triggers).
--   * Dropped (RETIRE) tables and intentionally-empty targets are
--     listed in the migration-flag comment block below.

